1
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:16,660
Qi Fengyin,

2
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:18,170
how did you do that?

3
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:21,100
You damaged your primal spirit again, didn't you?

4
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:26,400
Qi Fengyin,

5
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:27,610
let me take a look at you!

6
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:39,370
That was a dangerous spell.

7
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:40,640
Making the intangible solid

8
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,140
must have taken a toll on your body.

9
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:43,410
Let me check your pulse.

10
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:46,950
I'm fine.

11
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:49,900
Just listen.

12
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,410
I need some time to recover.

13
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:54,900
Until then,

14
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,330
I can't visit you through spirit projection.

15
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:57,540
But please,

16
00:01:00,350 --> 00:01:01,260
please watch out

17
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:02,330
for the people around Duyao.

18
00:01:27,940 --> 00:01:33,820
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

19
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:41,820
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

20
00:01:42,860 --> 00:01:47,100
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

21
00:01:50,780 --> 00:01:58,340
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

22
00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:05,460
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

23
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:13,340
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

24
00:02:14,540 --> 00:02:21,380
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

25
00:02:22,980 --> 00:02:29,500
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

26
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:36,060
[Blossom in Darkness]

27
00:02:36,060 --> 00:02:38,060
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

28
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:41,060
[Episode 21]

29
00:02:47,030 --> 00:02:47,890
Hao, didn't you

30
00:02:47,890 --> 00:02:48,660
seal this place long ago?

31
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,080
Who on earth

32
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,570
could have reopened this blood pool?

33
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,660
Someone's actually been

34
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,540
sacrificing people for the forbidden ritual.

35
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,130
Who else could it be?

36
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:58,850
This place is still full

37
00:02:58,870 --> 00:02:59,890
of dark energy.

38
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:02,220
Qi Fengyin was clearly just here.

39
00:03:02,630 --> 00:03:03,340
That devil

40
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:04,660
has snuck back again

41
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,850
without anyone noticing.

42
00:03:06,190 --> 00:03:07,010
Remember,

43
00:03:07,430 --> 00:03:08,410
breaking the blood pool's seal

44
00:03:08,750 --> 00:03:10,190
requires a secret technique known only

45
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:11,010
to our sect.

46
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,160
Even if Qi Fengyin

47
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:13,850
wanted to perform this forbidden ritual,

48
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:15,830
he'd need help

49
00:03:15,830 --> 00:03:16,980
from an insider.

50
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,610
Yamao trained

51
00:03:19,030 --> 00:03:20,380
with our sect for a while,

52
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,940
and she's mixed up with Qi Fengyin.

53
00:03:23,430 --> 00:03:24,260
And she's here

54
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:26,570
at Mount Zhaowu now.

55
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,540
High Immortal Danshen,

56
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:32,010
after all that's happened,

57
00:03:32,470 --> 00:03:33,670
why are you still letting her wreak havoc

58
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,500
and bring disaster

59
00:03:34,910 --> 00:03:35,690
upon the immortal sects?

60
00:03:35,910 --> 00:03:36,450
Zhiwei!

61
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,130
Many died because of this blood pool.

62
00:03:38,430 --> 00:03:39,850
The whole sect is counting on you, Master.

63
00:03:40,430 --> 00:03:41,890
Are you really going to put that criminal

64
00:03:42,630 --> 00:03:44,500
ahead of your own disciples' lives?

65
00:03:44,750 --> 00:03:47,170
Master, please arrest that criminal

66
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:48,610
and uncover the truth!

67
00:03:51,470 --> 00:03:52,540
You make it sound

68
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,660
as if you really saw

69
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,340
my disciple enter this blood pool

70
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,730
and reactivate the array.

71
00:03:58,190 --> 00:04:00,130
If I hadn't arrived when you did,

72
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:02,170
I'd think you'd caught her in the act.

73
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,660
So, High Immortal Danshen,

74
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,890
you insist on shielding that traitor.

75
00:04:10,910 --> 00:04:12,010
What have I done?

76
00:04:12,590 --> 00:04:13,730
How am I a traitor?

77
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:20,100
Mount Zhaowu is a major immortal sect

78
00:04:20,430 --> 00:04:21,410
that stands for what's right.

79
00:04:22,270 --> 00:04:23,460
Why do its disciples

80
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:25,700
keep making baseless accusations?

81
00:04:26,310 --> 00:04:27,900
I've spent the past few days recovering

82
00:04:28,270 --> 00:04:29,230
from a serious injury.

83
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:30,250
How could I have had the strength

84
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:31,580
to break the blood pool's seal?

85
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,100
Besides,

86
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:35,110
I trained at Mount Zhaowu

87
00:04:35,110 --> 00:04:36,290
for just over a month.

88
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:37,900
How could I have mastered

89
00:04:37,950 --> 00:04:39,250
all your sect's secret techniques?

90
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:44,100
There's no solid evidence yet.

91
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,410
Enough speculation.

92
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,020
We'll discuss this once I find out what happened.

93
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:48,730
Master,

94
00:04:49,430 --> 00:04:50,780
are you just going to let her off?

95
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,410
It's only natural

96
00:04:57,630 --> 00:04:58,610
for you to have doubts.

97
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,340
I know I'm in a delicate position.

98
00:05:01,190 --> 00:05:02,370
I don't want to cause trouble for Master Yuwen

99
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,020
or my master.

100
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:06,170
Until you find out what happened,

101
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,930
I'll confine myself to my chamber.

102
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,050
Master.

103
00:05:28,270 --> 00:05:28,930
Tell me,

104
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:30,980
what are you up to this time?

105
00:05:32,830 --> 00:05:34,100
You knew I was making trouble,

106
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,410
and you still let me have my way?

107
00:05:35,630 --> 00:05:37,460
If they'd insisted on declaring you guilty,

108
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,250
I could have taken you away by force.

109
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:40,780
As far as I'm concerned,

110
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,460
reputation means nothing.

111
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,220
But Yuwen Hao already had things under control,

112
00:05:45,390 --> 00:05:46,850
yet you still offered to confine yourself.

113
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:49,980
You made that choice yourself,

114
00:05:50,270 --> 00:05:51,660
so I could only go along with it.

115
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,580
I didn't break the blood pool's seal.

116
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,580
If I don't clear my name,

117
00:05:56,830 --> 00:05:58,410
it'll cause even bigger problems sooner or later.

118
00:05:58,750 --> 00:05:59,900
By confining myself for now,

119
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,730
I can get whoever's trying to frame me

120
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:02,700
to let their guard down.

121
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,020
So you have an idea

122
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:06,660
who's trying to frame you.

123
00:06:08,190 --> 00:06:09,020
I need your help, Master.

124
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:18,860
[Strive to Cultivate Noble Virtue]

125
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,580
We've recalled all our disciples

126
00:06:20,830 --> 00:06:22,340
and investigated everyone several times.

127
00:06:22,750 --> 00:06:23,540
No one could be

128
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,410
in league with Qi Fengyin.

129
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:25,850
I bet Yamao

130
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:26,930
is faking her injuries

131
00:06:27,310 --> 00:06:28,540
so she can stay at Mount Zhaowu

132
00:06:28,630 --> 00:06:30,050
and help Qi Fengyin from the inside.

133
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:47,980
High Immortal Danshen,

134
00:06:48,430 --> 00:06:49,250
what's this for?

135
00:06:49,830 --> 00:06:50,780
I searched day and night

136
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,170
and found this spell.

137
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,810
Whoever reopened the blood pool

138
00:06:55,070 --> 00:06:56,370
must have left traces.

139
00:06:56,950 --> 00:06:57,610
Yuwen Hao,

140
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,930
you only need to use this spell

141
00:07:00,070 --> 00:07:00,930
to examine those traces,

142
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:03,100
and you'll know for sure

143
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:04,780
who left them behind.

144
00:07:05,750 --> 00:07:06,410
Then

145
00:07:07,070 --> 00:07:07,980
everyone at Mount Zhaowu

146
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,410
who falsely accused Yamao

147
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,220
must apologize to her

148
00:07:11,570 --> 00:07:12,220
in person.

149
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,290
Yinhua,

150
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:17,250
summon all the disciples

151
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:18,490
to the blood pool at once.

152
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,140
Yes.

153
00:07:38,270 --> 00:07:40,020
This looks close enough

154
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:41,730
to what Qingxing drew, right?

155
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:57,730
Back then,

156
00:07:57,750 --> 00:07:59,410
whenever Yamao got hurt,

157
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,580
I'd secretly collect some of her spirit essence

158
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,220
just in case.

159
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,290
I just hope there's enough spiritual energy here

160
00:08:04,510 --> 00:08:05,850
to activate the array.

161
00:08:07,510 --> 00:08:09,020
I have no choice but to try.

162
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:09,980
It's all Qingxing's fault.

163
00:08:38,270 --> 00:08:39,890
Are you trying to erase the traces

164
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,980
before anyone else gets here?

165
00:08:44,630 --> 00:08:45,700
Weren't you confined to your chamber?

166
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,490
Did Danshen help you sneak out?

167
00:08:47,630 --> 00:08:48,130
That's right.

168
00:08:48,630 --> 00:08:49,890
I've been waiting for you here.

169
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,700
You and I still have

170
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,580
a score to settle.

171
00:08:52,870 --> 00:08:54,530
Did you think I'd let you off so easily?

172
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:01,730
Outside Mount Jigu,

173
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,460
I was putting everything I had

174
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,300
into keeping the shield up,

175
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,340
which left you an opening.

176
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:07,850
Yinhua,

177
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,340
I've let you off more than once.

178
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:10,940
You didn't really think I was

179
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:11,610
afraid of you, did you?

180
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,250
If you're going to kill me, do it.

181
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,370
Spare me the speech.

182
00:09:27,150 --> 00:09:27,850
That was

183
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,420
for what you did

184
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:31,060
to me at Mount Jigu.

185
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,940
I have no interest in killing you.

186
00:09:35,150 --> 00:09:35,890
Stop right there!

187
00:09:40,550 --> 00:09:42,420
As for the lives you took by reopening the blood pool,

188
00:09:43,630 --> 00:09:45,490
your own sect can hold you to account.

189
00:10:11,390 --> 00:10:12,340
There was never

190
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,300
any such spell.

191
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,010
All we had to do

192
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,340
was wait and see

193
00:10:16,510 --> 00:10:17,770
who'd come rushing to the blood pool

194
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,770
to erase the traces.

195
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,490
Then we'd know the truth.

196
00:10:21,630 --> 00:10:22,340
Yuwen Hao,

197
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,060
Mount Zhaowu's internal affairs

198
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:24,820
don't interest me.

199
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,220
What happens next

200
00:10:26,510 --> 00:10:27,730
is up to you.

201
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:34,820
Yinhua.

202
00:10:40,630 --> 00:10:41,610
Why did you do it?

203
00:10:43,550 --> 00:10:44,180
I...

204
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:45,890
It's a misunderstanding.

205
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,130
I can explain.

206
00:10:47,390 --> 00:10:48,460
- It's all a misunderstanding.
- Still making excuses?

207
00:11:02,750 --> 00:11:03,890
- She's... - She's...

208
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:04,850
She's a woman?

209
00:11:04,870 --> 00:11:05,610
Am I seeing things?

210
00:11:05,630 --> 00:11:06,650
That can't be.

211
00:11:07,870 --> 00:11:08,730
How can she be a woman?

212
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:09,540
I know.

213
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:10,730
Why hide who she is?

214
00:11:13,670 --> 00:11:15,460
Uncle Yinhua is actually a woman?

215
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:16,890
Where did she get an artifact

216
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,420
that could hide her true form?

217
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:19,610
Does Master Yuwen know?

218
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:25,300
Our sect has never had female disciples.

219
00:11:26,030 --> 00:11:26,580
That's right.

220
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:27,730
What's she after?

221
00:11:27,750 --> 00:11:28,980
She broke the rules.

222
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,340
This has never happened before.

223
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,060
And no one noticed.

224
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:38,890
What a disgrace!

225
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:39,650
Exactly.

226
00:11:42,750 --> 00:11:43,220
Yinhua!

227
00:11:43,750 --> 00:11:44,220
Yinhua.

228
00:11:45,750 --> 00:11:47,100
Master, my fellow disciples,

229
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,130
Yinhua has done wrong.

230
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,300
I failed to keep her in line.

231
00:11:49,630 --> 00:11:50,770
I told her to disguise herself as a man.

232
00:11:50,790 --> 00:11:51,610
It's all my fault!

233
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,980
Please spare her life, Master!

234
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:55,370
What is he talking about?

235
00:11:55,390 --> 00:11:57,250
Uncle Qingxing was behind this?

236
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:58,530
How could he do this?

237
00:11:58,550 --> 00:11:59,490
What was it all for?

238
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,460
To protect our sect's good name,

239
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,580
Yinhua must die.

240
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,010
Master...

241
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:18,820
Qingxing!

242
00:12:20,870 --> 00:12:21,850
Whatever you want to do,

243
00:12:24,390 --> 00:12:25,370
go ahead.

244
00:12:40,630 --> 00:12:41,490
Take Yinhua

245
00:12:45,510 --> 00:12:47,100
to Wuchang Prison's lowest level.

246
00:12:49,150 --> 00:12:50,370
She's to remain there

247
00:12:52,030 --> 00:12:52,980
for the rest of her life.

248
00:12:54,670 --> 00:12:55,300
Yes!

249
00:13:11,910 --> 00:13:12,530
Where did they go?

250
00:13:12,630 --> 00:13:13,100
They're gone.

251
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:13,820
What?

252
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:14,530
They...

253
00:13:14,550 --> 00:13:15,010
Where are they?

254
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,010
- They... - Where did they go?

255
00:13:16,030 --> 00:13:16,490
Where did they go?

256
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:19,820
Qingxing,

257
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:22,010
what are you doing?

258
00:13:23,630 --> 00:13:24,770
I'm getting you out of here.

259
00:13:27,030 --> 00:13:28,850
Don't you see by now?

260
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:31,010
I've done terrible things

261
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,530
and taken countless lives.

262
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:35,060
Now even death

263
00:13:35,270 --> 00:13:36,370
is too much to ask for.

264
00:13:37,270 --> 00:13:38,940
You grew up right by my side,

265
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:40,930
and I didn't even notice

266
00:13:40,930 --> 00:13:41,820
when you went astray.

267
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:43,580
Yinhua,

268
00:13:44,630 --> 00:13:46,250
whatever you've done,

269
00:13:46,630 --> 00:13:48,340
let me take the blame, all right?

270
00:13:49,270 --> 00:13:50,530
Then you can change your ways

271
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:51,850
and start over.

272
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,180
Once you leave Mount Zhaowu,

273
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:57,820
go somewhere far away and lie low.

274
00:13:58,750 --> 00:13:59,490
Yinhua,

275
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:00,940
you can live openly as a woman

276
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,820
and dress however you like.

277
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,890
You won't have to hide anymore.

278
00:14:07,270 --> 00:14:08,490
Just listen to me this once.

279
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:13,850
I owe you this much.

280
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:22,850
My little sister,

281
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:25,130
look.

282
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,580
Doesn't that path up ahead

283
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:29,180
look like the mountain path

284
00:14:30,390 --> 00:14:31,820
by the village we grew up in?

285
00:14:34,150 --> 00:14:35,220
Do you still remember?

286
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:37,490
When you were little,

287
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:39,610
you'd pretend you'd twisted your ankle

288
00:14:40,030 --> 00:14:42,060
and cry and beg me to carry you.

289
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:46,650
I can't even remember

290
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:48,010
how long it's been

291
00:14:48,790 --> 00:14:50,720
since I carried you like this.

292
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:53,530
Brother,

293
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:56,370
I'm sorry.

294
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:08,300
I told you

295
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,580
I'd do things my way

296
00:15:14,670 --> 00:15:16,610
to protect the people I care about.

297
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,460
This was my fault,

298
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,460
and I'll answer for it myself.

299
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:59,130
Why did you reopen the blood pool?

300
00:16:00,550 --> 00:16:01,370
To train.

301
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,490
I need to master the most powerful technique

302
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,940
to protect the people I care about.

303
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,130
Those disciples

304
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:09,650
spent every day with us.

305
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,010
Some of them

306
00:16:11,670 --> 00:16:13,580
joined the sect when you did

307
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:14,610
and grew up with you.

308
00:16:14,870 --> 00:16:16,220
You say it like it was nothing.

309
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:18,340
To master a technique?

310
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:22,220
How can you be so cruel?

311
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,100
You're beyond saving!

312
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,490
The lowest level of Wuchang Prison

313
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:28,700
is where you'll stay from now on.

314
00:16:29,390 --> 00:16:30,980
I hope the bitter cold here

315
00:16:31,790 --> 00:16:33,130
makes you repent soon.

316
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,980
Is that all you have to say to me?

317
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:41,890
Hao,

318
00:16:44,750 --> 00:16:45,820
this is probably

319
00:16:48,910 --> 00:16:50,820
the last time I'll ever see you

320
00:16:52,030 --> 00:16:53,700
and my last chance to warn you.

321
00:16:54,630 --> 00:16:55,650
Our master

322
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,490
sought to resolve a matter of the heart.

323
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:00,010
Obsessed, he went astray

324
00:17:00,630 --> 00:17:01,650
and did terrible harm.

325
00:17:02,270 --> 00:17:04,620
- You... - You urge me to purge my inner demons

326
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,180
and strengthen my faith.

327
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:08,420
But look at what you've done.

328
00:17:08,810 --> 00:17:09,840
How is your ending

329
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:10,980
any different from our master?

330
00:17:14,070 --> 00:17:14,660
Yinhua,

331
00:17:16,030 --> 00:17:17,860
your faith in the immortal path never wavered.

332
00:17:18,750 --> 00:17:19,830
So why...?

333
00:17:19,830 --> 00:17:20,770
How do you know

334
00:17:21,510 --> 00:17:23,120
my faith never wavered?

335
00:17:29,550 --> 00:17:30,770
You saved me that day

336
00:17:33,030 --> 00:17:34,330
and carried me to Mount Zhaowu.

337
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:35,700
So why is it now

338
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:37,200
that you won't even

339
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,220
spare me a glance?

340
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,250
Is it because I dressed as a man?

341
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:45,290
Do you think I'm disgusting

342
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,940
like everyone else does?

343
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:05,900
Remember when you were 18

344
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,860
and Master had me whipped?

345
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:10,140
That day,

346
00:18:12,110 --> 00:18:13,220
I snuck down the mountain.

347
00:18:15,070 --> 00:18:16,180
To cover for me,

348
00:18:17,070 --> 00:18:18,220
you lied to Master.

349
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,660
When you snuck down the mountain that day,

350
00:18:23,350 --> 00:18:24,380
you didn't go drinking.

351
00:18:26,270 --> 00:18:27,530
Instead, you bought a box of rouge

352
00:18:32,110 --> 00:18:34,010
and hid it under your bed.

353
00:18:35,110 --> 00:18:36,700
Before I brought you back to Mount Zhaowu,

354
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:40,140
I already knew everything.

355
00:18:41,110 --> 00:18:42,770
It was never a secret to me,

356
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:45,810
and it never bothered me.

357
00:18:49,550 --> 00:18:50,330
You knew?

358
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:59,250
So you knew everything.

359
00:19:01,070 --> 00:19:03,090
The secret I held so dear

360
00:19:03,830 --> 00:19:05,940
and the feelings I tried so hard to hide...

361
00:19:07,350 --> 00:19:08,620
You knew everything

362
00:19:11,030 --> 00:19:12,660
from the very beginning.

363
00:19:17,310 --> 00:19:18,980
If you knew all along,

364
00:19:22,310 --> 00:19:23,050
then why...?

365
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:23,940
At Mount Zhaowu,

366
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,660
we follow the Path of Detachment.

367
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:30,530
As sect leader,

368
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:33,050
I will never give my heart to anyone.

369
00:19:33,070 --> 00:19:33,840
You're lying!

370
00:19:35,310 --> 00:19:37,050
You have feelings for Yamao.

371
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:39,370
The very moment

372
00:19:39,370 --> 00:19:40,530
she took your spiritual mark,

373
00:19:41,790 --> 00:19:42,940
you fell in love with her.

374
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:45,700
I admit it.

375
00:19:47,070 --> 00:19:48,090
I'm jealous of Yamao.

376
00:19:49,510 --> 00:19:51,120
That's why I kept

377
00:19:51,120 --> 00:19:52,220
trying to kill her.

378
00:19:53,030 --> 00:19:54,730
I've never asked you to return my feelings.

379
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,250
But I can't...

380
00:19:57,830 --> 00:19:58,660
I can't watch you

381
00:19:58,680 --> 00:19:59,770
make the same mistakes Master did!

382
00:19:59,790 --> 00:20:01,180
So what if I have feelings for her?

383
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:03,660
Loving someone

384
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:06,980
doesn't mean you have to say it out loud.

385
00:20:09,510 --> 00:20:10,770
Even if I have to bury my feelings

386
00:20:10,830 --> 00:20:11,700
deep in my heart,

387
00:20:12,790 --> 00:20:14,050
I'll never stand by

388
00:20:14,070 --> 00:20:15,090
and watch her face danger

389
00:20:15,110 --> 00:20:16,010
without doing a thing.

390
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:19,980
I'll protect the people I care about.

391
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:22,840
Our master kept running

392
00:20:22,840 --> 00:20:23,490
from his feelings

393
00:20:23,510 --> 00:20:24,570
until they turned into inner demons.

394
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:29,100
♪As if asking why you and I...♪

395
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:33,940
I'm not our master,

396
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:36,290
and Yamao

397
00:20:39,140 --> 00:20:42,100
♪All I see is you...♪

398
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:43,860
isn't Hua Changpu.

399
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:55,620
Aren't you going to check on him?

400
00:20:57,270 --> 00:20:58,040
I'm sure

401
00:20:58,040 --> 00:20:59,460
he's still worried about his sister.

402
00:21:00,790 --> 00:21:01,960
After the way

403
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:02,860
Yinhua went after you,

404
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:04,560
I can't think of anything

405
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:05,420
I could say to comfort him.

406
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:06,980
I'd rather stay away.

407
00:21:08,030 --> 00:21:08,770
Besides,

408
00:21:09,590 --> 00:21:10,620
the one I'm most worried about

409
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:11,380
is His Lordship.

410
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,460
The soul whistle still hasn't responded.

411
00:21:18,070 --> 00:21:19,810
I wonder how he's doing.

412
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:22,420
He told me not to look for him.

413
00:21:26,270 --> 00:21:26,900
Yamao,

414
00:21:27,590 --> 00:21:29,180
His Lordship is free of the Wanjun Lock,

415
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:30,940
and the Saintess of the Tides is in seclusion.

416
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:32,250
No one can touch him.

417
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:33,730
Maybe

418
00:21:34,030 --> 00:21:35,900
he used up too much power helping you

419
00:21:36,030 --> 00:21:37,490
and just needs a few more days of sleep.

420
00:21:39,510 --> 00:21:40,180
Right.

421
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,570
He's free of the Wanjun Lock.

422
00:21:43,310 --> 00:21:44,330
Who but the Saintess of the Tides

423
00:21:45,350 --> 00:21:46,990
could put him in danger?

424
00:21:52,790 --> 00:21:54,860
Whoever lured me to the blood pool that night

425
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:56,250
had to know

426
00:21:56,270 --> 00:21:57,220
he was with me.

427
00:21:58,960 --> 00:21:59,700
No wonder Qi Fengyin

428
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:01,180
warned me about those around the Saintess.

429
00:22:02,070 --> 00:22:03,420
He knew what was going on all along!

430
00:22:04,030 --> 00:22:05,660
What do you mean, Yamao?

431
00:22:06,350 --> 00:22:07,380
I need to see the Saintess.

432
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:22,530
You kept trying to help her,

433
00:22:23,750 --> 00:22:24,810
wearing yourself down bit by bit

434
00:22:24,830 --> 00:22:26,290
until you ended up like this.

435
00:22:27,400 --> 00:22:29,290
You could've spared yourself all this misery.

436
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:40,530
Let me put an end to it all for you.

437
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:50,050
You still have strength left?

438
00:23:19,790 --> 00:23:20,380
Big Brother,

439
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:22,570
if I were in danger

440
00:23:23,030 --> 00:23:24,010
and someone tried to kill me,

441
00:23:25,440 --> 00:23:26,490
would you protect me?

442
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:28,940
Why do you ask?

443
00:23:34,070 --> 00:23:35,380
Because I won't let anyone

444
00:23:35,960 --> 00:23:37,140
or anything hurt you.

445
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:03,490
That was your last chance,

446
00:24:05,070 --> 00:24:06,330
and once again, you threw it away.

447
00:24:08,110 --> 00:24:09,180
Who'd have thought

448
00:24:09,790 --> 00:24:12,330
the fearsome devil who once slaughtered thousands

449
00:24:14,110 --> 00:24:15,730
would go soft so easily?

450
00:24:18,790 --> 00:24:19,770
Someone like you

451
00:24:21,680 --> 00:24:23,770
won't survive in this world.

452
00:24:31,640 --> 00:24:34,420
Welcome back from seclusion, Saintess of the Tides!

453
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:39,900
I've gathered the immortal sects here today

454
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:42,460
to address your greatest concern.

455
00:24:43,310 --> 00:24:44,770
I have something to show you.

456
00:24:51,440 --> 00:24:52,140
That's...

457
00:24:52,140 --> 00:24:55,180
What on earth is that?

458
00:24:55,590 --> 00:24:57,010
What is it?

459
00:25:00,240 --> 00:25:01,620
Isn't that the Devil's Heart?

460
00:25:02,310 --> 00:25:02,980
The Devil's Heart?

461
00:25:03,110 --> 00:25:03,770
That's...

462
00:25:03,790 --> 00:25:04,860
That's the Devil's Heart.

463
00:25:05,310 --> 00:25:06,380
It's so small.

464
00:25:06,640 --> 00:25:07,940
It's brimming with dark energy.

465
00:25:08,510 --> 00:25:10,010
It really is Qi Fengyin's Devil's Heart.

466
00:25:13,070 --> 00:25:13,900
How can this be?

467
00:25:16,030 --> 00:25:17,620
I've gravely wounded Qi Fengyin

468
00:25:18,590 --> 00:25:20,380
and trapped him on Mount Qihuang.

469
00:25:20,830 --> 00:25:22,460
Does anyone still have doubts?

470
00:25:22,590 --> 00:25:23,810
No one in the immortal sects

471
00:25:23,830 --> 00:25:25,010
has ever wounded Qi Fengyin so gravely.

472
00:25:25,440 --> 00:25:26,810
Your divine power is truly extraordinary, Saintess.

473
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:27,700
You have our full support.

474
00:25:27,790 --> 00:25:29,900
We were wrong to speak rashly of you, Saintess.

475
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:31,730
Please punish us as you see fit.

476
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:42,700
Now that you see your mistake,

477
00:25:43,110 --> 00:25:44,900
fuse the five Sect Leaders' Tokens

478
00:25:44,920 --> 00:25:45,660
into the Immortal Sect Token.

479
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:48,460
Tomorrow, join me in attacking Mount Qihuang

480
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:51,290
to kill Qi Fengyin once and for all.

481
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:55,330
As you command, Saintess!

482
00:26:29,030 --> 00:26:30,180
Storm Mount Qihuang.

483
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:33,140
Slay Qi Fengyin.

484
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:34,980
Storm Mount Qihuang!

485
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:36,700
Slay Qi Fengyin!

486
00:26:41,790 --> 00:26:42,420
Yamao.

487
00:26:52,030 --> 00:26:53,250
Did you see the Saintess?

488
00:26:56,350 --> 00:26:58,090
She cut out Qi Fengyin's Devil's Heart.

489
00:26:59,270 --> 00:26:59,900
That's impossible!

490
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:02,860
Yamao, could you be mistaken?

491
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:05,250
But all the immortal sects

492
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:07,050
were at the assembly just now.

493
00:27:07,750 --> 00:27:08,900
I saw it with my own eyes.

494
00:27:09,590 --> 00:27:10,940
It was Qi Fengyin's Devil's Heart.

495
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:13,010
If His Lordship's really lost the Devil's Heart,

496
00:27:14,310 --> 00:27:16,050
does that mean he's lost his powers?

497
00:27:28,400 --> 00:27:29,810
He made this from his primal spirit.

498
00:27:31,030 --> 00:27:32,460
Now even the soul whistle is gone.

499
00:27:33,790 --> 00:27:34,940
Yamao, don't panic.

500
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:35,900
So that's why

501
00:27:35,920 --> 00:27:36,900
he kept everything from me.

502
00:27:37,310 --> 00:27:37,810
All this time,

503
00:27:37,830 --> 00:27:39,330
the Saintess had him trapped.

504
00:27:39,920 --> 00:27:41,050
I...

505
00:27:42,400 --> 00:27:43,490
There might still be hope.

506
00:27:43,830 --> 00:27:44,900
His Lordship promised us.

507
00:27:45,200 --> 00:27:46,620
He said he'd come get us.

508
00:27:46,830 --> 00:27:47,900
But the Saintess will lead

509
00:27:48,480 --> 00:27:49,750
the Five Great Sects and all the others

510
00:27:49,750 --> 00:27:50,730
to attack Mount Qihuang tomorrow.

511
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:51,810
Then what

512
00:27:51,830 --> 00:27:52,860
can we do now?

513
00:27:54,200 --> 00:27:55,290
The dark mark that links us is still there.

514
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:56,900
I can use it

515
00:27:57,550 --> 00:27:58,900
to send my spirit into his dream

516
00:27:59,480 --> 00:28:00,250
and see him there.

517
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:07,860
No matter what,

518
00:28:08,440 --> 00:28:09,700
I have to see you this time.

519
00:28:17,550 --> 00:28:18,220
Qi Fengyin.

520
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:26,700
Yamao.

521
00:28:28,110 --> 00:28:29,140
I saw Qi Fengyin.

522
00:28:30,920 --> 00:28:31,900
He's in bad shape.

523
00:28:32,750 --> 00:28:33,420
Really bad.

524
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:35,730
But he's not on Mount Qihuang at all.

525
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:44,980
If His Lordship isn't on Mount Qihuang,

526
00:28:45,110 --> 00:28:45,810
why did the Saintess

527
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:46,910
lie to everyone?

528
00:28:46,910 --> 00:28:48,500
The Saintess locked him in the Crystal Prison.

529
00:28:48,500 --> 00:28:49,760
We'll have to get that artifact first

530
00:28:49,790 --> 00:28:50,570
to save him.

531
00:28:50,570 --> 00:28:51,240
[Ever Diligent, Ever Vigilant]

532
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:52,480
He can't get out,

533
00:28:52,640 --> 00:28:53,620
so we'll go get him this time.

534
00:28:54,720 --> 00:28:55,290
Wait.

535
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:57,180
Are you sure no one's inside?

536
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:58,420
I'm sure.

537
00:29:24,590 --> 00:29:25,330
What's wrong?

538
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:28,570
I think something's coming toward us.

539
00:29:28,880 --> 00:29:29,730
You're probably imagining it.

540
00:29:59,070 --> 00:29:59,860
Let's look around first.

541
00:30:08,350 --> 00:30:09,620
Judging by that look,

542
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:11,180
you're wondering

543
00:30:11,550 --> 00:30:12,700
why I'm here.

544
00:30:13,030 --> 00:30:14,140
I'm wondering

545
00:30:15,510 --> 00:30:17,090
what gave you the nerve to draw your sword on me.

546
00:30:19,790 --> 00:30:20,580
I have no interest

547
00:30:20,580 --> 00:30:22,090
in the reason

548
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:23,980
you came here.

549
00:30:24,550 --> 00:30:25,900
But Yamao is my disciple.

550
00:30:26,310 --> 00:30:27,620
I won't let you hurt her again.

551
00:30:30,750 --> 00:30:33,140
As the guardian of the Saintess of the Tides,

552
00:30:34,110 --> 00:30:36,180
aren't you afraid that if you defy me, you'll be...

553
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:41,660
What did you do to me?

554
00:30:43,680 --> 00:30:44,810
I've placed a divine curse

555
00:30:45,160 --> 00:30:46,290
within you.

556
00:30:46,920 --> 00:30:48,860
If you so much as lay a finger on her again,

557
00:30:49,270 --> 00:30:50,380
divine punishment will follow.

558
00:30:50,640 --> 00:30:51,940
Your body will crumble to dust,

559
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:53,420
and your soul will be destroyed.

560
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:54,860
If you don't believe me,

561
00:30:55,750 --> 00:30:56,810
try it.

562
00:31:02,830 --> 00:31:03,620
Then go back

563
00:31:03,640 --> 00:31:04,570
and teach your disciple

564
00:31:04,590 --> 00:31:05,250
how to behave.

565
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:06,770
Tell her to follow your example

566
00:31:07,880 --> 00:31:09,980
and stay out of my affairs.

567
00:31:14,260 --> 00:31:17,550
[Ever Diligent, Ever Vigilant]

568
00:31:17,550 --> 00:31:19,530
We turned the place upside down.

569
00:31:20,030 --> 00:31:21,570
How come we couldn't find anything?

570
00:31:29,750 --> 00:31:30,620
Master?

571
00:31:40,750 --> 00:31:41,420
Master,

572
00:31:41,640 --> 00:31:42,380
that was my friend,

573
00:31:42,640 --> 00:31:43,220
Youyou.

574
00:31:43,790 --> 00:31:45,700
Why did you sneak into the Saintess's chamber?

575
00:31:46,830 --> 00:31:49,090
Well, we were...

576
00:31:50,160 --> 00:31:50,730
Lost?

577
00:31:51,110 --> 00:31:51,490
Right!

578
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:52,980
We got lost.

579
00:31:53,750 --> 00:31:55,010
Nothing gets past you, Master.

580
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:58,330
I'm your master.

581
00:31:58,680 --> 00:31:59,760
Of course I know you

582
00:31:59,760 --> 00:32:00,810
better than most people do.

583
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:02,810
I know when you're telling the truth

584
00:32:02,960 --> 00:32:04,050
and when you're lying.

585
00:32:04,400 --> 00:32:05,570
Whatever excuse you come up with

586
00:32:05,570 --> 00:32:06,250
to fool me,

587
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:08,180
you can be sure

588
00:32:09,030 --> 00:32:10,770
I'll see right through it.

589
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:16,490
I'm sorry, Master.

590
00:32:17,110 --> 00:32:17,900
The truth is,

591
00:32:19,110 --> 00:32:20,900
I've been investigating the Saintess of the Tides.

592
00:32:21,310 --> 00:32:22,330
I know she has

593
00:32:22,350 --> 00:32:23,220
unquestionable authority

594
00:32:23,480 --> 00:32:24,220
among the immortal sects.

595
00:32:24,310 --> 00:32:25,010
You may find this

596
00:32:25,030 --> 00:32:26,050
hard to believe, Master,

597
00:32:26,480 --> 00:32:28,140
but Qi Fengyin isn't on Mount Qihuang at all.

598
00:32:28,590 --> 00:32:29,660
I can't understand

599
00:32:29,830 --> 00:32:30,980
why she'd lie to everyone.

600
00:32:31,480 --> 00:32:32,770
How do you know

601
00:32:33,030 --> 00:32:34,770
Qi Fengyin isn't on Mount Qihuang?

602
00:32:41,440 --> 00:32:42,140
Master,

603
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:44,050
you don't believe me either?

604
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:53,660
I believe you.

605
00:32:55,070 --> 00:32:56,700
You risked your life today

606
00:32:57,000 --> 00:32:58,380
to sneak into the Saintess's chamber.

607
00:32:58,750 --> 00:32:59,380
That tells me

608
00:32:59,400 --> 00:33:01,050
you must have solid evidence.

609
00:33:01,550 --> 00:33:02,460
But Yamao,

610
00:33:03,070 --> 00:33:03,810
if you need help,

611
00:33:04,510 --> 00:33:05,530
you can always come to me.

612
00:33:08,880 --> 00:33:10,380
I don't want to make things harder for you.

613
00:33:11,790 --> 00:33:13,250
After we got back from Mount Jigu,

614
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:15,660
you vouched for me before the immortal sects.

615
00:33:16,440 --> 00:33:17,570
That put you in a delicate position.

616
00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:19,660
I don't want to drag you into trouble again.

617
00:33:24,830 --> 00:33:26,730
You'd only worry about burdening someone

618
00:33:28,030 --> 00:33:29,380
if you saw them as an outsider.

619
00:33:36,680 --> 00:33:37,220
I...

620
00:33:37,440 --> 00:33:38,050
It's all right.

621
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:39,660
I'll go back to Luoshen Valley

622
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:41,170
and see if I can

623
00:33:41,270 --> 00:33:42,570
find anything to help you.

624
00:33:42,750 --> 00:33:43,660
But promise me

625
00:33:44,070 --> 00:33:45,250
you won't sneak in here again.

626
00:33:58,110 --> 00:33:59,900
When will your master be back?

627
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:02,330
What if he can't find a way to help?

628
00:34:03,070 --> 00:34:04,900
You won't give up on His Lordship, will you?

629
00:34:06,200 --> 00:34:07,380
Of course we're saving Qi Fengyin.

630
00:34:09,190 --> 00:34:09,940
But

631
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:12,530
why would the Saintess lead the immortal sects

632
00:34:13,110 --> 00:34:13,900
on a wild goose chase?

633
00:34:20,710 --> 00:34:21,380
Yamao?

634
00:34:25,670 --> 00:34:26,300
Hao,

635
00:34:26,630 --> 00:34:27,130
I...

636
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:28,050
Tomorrow,

637
00:34:28,280 --> 00:34:29,700
are you leading the Mount Zhaowu disciples

638
00:34:29,700 --> 00:34:30,490
to Mount Qihuang?

639
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:31,590
Are you asking

640
00:34:32,030 --> 00:34:33,130
because you're worried about Qi Fengyin?

641
00:34:33,630 --> 00:34:35,300
Qi Fengyin isn't on Mount Qihuang at all.

642
00:34:36,710 --> 00:34:37,980
The Saintess of the Tides lied to you.

643
00:34:38,230 --> 00:34:38,780
Yamao,

644
00:34:39,760 --> 00:34:41,330
do you know what you're saying?

645
00:34:41,670 --> 00:34:42,660
I know it sounds

646
00:34:42,660 --> 00:34:43,690
far-fetched,

647
00:34:44,320 --> 00:34:45,150
but I'm worried

648
00:34:45,150 --> 00:34:46,020
something might go wrong.

649
00:34:46,070 --> 00:34:47,010
You have no proof.

650
00:34:47,550 --> 00:34:48,540
Jumping to conclusions like this

651
00:34:48,670 --> 00:34:49,380
is out of line.

652
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:49,780
I...

653
00:34:52,400 --> 00:34:53,460
Even if you're right,

654
00:34:54,230 --> 00:34:55,570
my word alone

655
00:34:56,030 --> 00:34:57,010
won't be enough to stop

656
00:34:57,030 --> 00:34:58,210
tomorrow's attack.

657
00:34:58,630 --> 00:34:59,260
Besides,

658
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:02,260
the Saintess has the Immortal Sect Token.

659
00:35:05,550 --> 00:35:06,740
I can't figure out

660
00:35:07,510 --> 00:35:08,610
why she'd do this either.

661
00:35:11,840 --> 00:35:12,530
Hao,

662
00:35:13,440 --> 00:35:14,530
I have a backup plan.

663
00:35:21,110 --> 00:35:21,690
Your hand.

664
00:35:29,670 --> 00:35:30,460
What's this for?

665
00:35:30,630 --> 00:35:31,380
It may help

666
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:32,490
if things go wrong.

667
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:46,900
The Five Great Sects are on their way to Mount Qihuang.

668
00:35:47,710 --> 00:35:49,090
I hope it's not too late.

669
00:35:57,920 --> 00:35:59,110
She actually left the artifact

670
00:35:59,110 --> 00:35:59,790
behind.

671
00:36:08,070 --> 00:36:08,640
His Lordship's trapped

672
00:36:08,640 --> 00:36:10,020
inside this blasted thing.

673
00:36:10,400 --> 00:36:11,420
I'll smash it.

674
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:12,300
Youyou,

675
00:36:12,710 --> 00:36:13,490
it's a divine artifact.

676
00:36:14,110 --> 00:36:15,340
It won't be easy to break.

677
00:36:17,440 --> 00:36:18,460
Since I took form from a wisp

678
00:36:18,510 --> 00:36:19,380
of the Saintess's divine power,

679
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:21,690
the spirit essence from my herb core might be enough

680
00:36:22,110 --> 00:36:23,570
to break the Crystal Prison.

681
00:36:36,630 --> 00:36:37,530
What happened?

682
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:39,170
She left behind an array.

683
00:36:39,760 --> 00:36:40,860
Touch it, and her divine power

684
00:36:41,280 --> 00:36:42,780
will lash out at you.

685
00:36:45,590 --> 00:36:46,340
So we can't get through

686
00:36:46,360 --> 00:36:47,690
even if we take the hit?

687
00:37:08,550 --> 00:37:09,490
The Saintess of the Tides said

688
00:37:09,510 --> 00:37:11,380
she'd imprisoned Qi Fengyin here,

689
00:37:12,190 --> 00:37:13,690
but there's no sign of him anywhere.

690
00:37:13,960 --> 00:37:15,460
Did that devil escape again?

691
00:37:16,110 --> 00:37:17,860
Qi Fengyin isn't on Mount Qihuang at all.

692
00:37:18,710 --> 00:37:19,940
The Saintess of the Tides lied to you.

693
00:37:21,480 --> 00:37:22,130
Everyone,

694
00:37:22,800 --> 00:37:24,090
withdraw from Mount Qihuang at once!

695
00:37:32,760 --> 00:37:34,170
Wasn't the seal the Saintess left here

696
00:37:34,230 --> 00:37:35,210
broken long ago?

697
00:37:36,070 --> 00:37:36,610
Is this a new one

698
00:37:36,630 --> 00:37:37,820
meant to trap Qi Fengyin?

699
00:37:38,150 --> 00:37:38,900
I'm afraid

700
00:37:39,630 --> 00:37:40,820
it's meant to trap us.

701
00:37:56,630 --> 00:37:59,190
The Immortal Sect Token can draw power from the five sacred lands.

702
00:38:00,190 --> 00:38:01,570
I wonder if Mount Qihuang

703
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:04,300
is within their bounds

704
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:06,980
and will heed the token's command.

705
00:38:10,280 --> 00:38:12,130
You went to great lengths to get the Immortal Sect Token.

706
00:38:12,920 --> 00:38:14,340
Under the pretext of killing the Devil Incarnate,

707
00:38:15,070 --> 00:38:16,340
you gathered the Five Great Sects' elite

708
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:17,300
here on Mount Qihuang.

709
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:19,210
What are you really after?

710
00:38:44,630 --> 00:38:45,460
A blood pool?

711
00:38:46,070 --> 00:38:47,260
The blood pool Du Zhong built

712
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:50,170
on Mount Zhaowu was far too crude.

713
00:38:50,920 --> 00:38:52,420
I'll use this place

714
00:38:52,710 --> 00:38:54,210
to perform the forbidden ritual again

715
00:38:55,070 --> 00:38:56,980
and refine your immortal cores

716
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:59,130
to make their power mine.

717
00:38:59,960 --> 00:39:01,380
So you were the one who forced Yinhua

718
00:39:01,550 --> 00:39:02,610
to reopen the blood pool!

719
00:39:24,280 --> 00:39:24,900
Saintess,

720
00:39:25,230 --> 00:39:26,300
you wield the power of a deity.

721
00:39:26,510 --> 00:39:27,490
Why do you need our immortal cores?

722
00:39:27,760 --> 00:39:29,210
Whether they're of any use to me

723
00:39:29,230 --> 00:39:29,900
doesn't matter.

724
00:39:30,230 --> 00:39:32,090
I want every immortal sect

725
00:39:32,440 --> 00:39:34,460
to perish by my hand today!

726
00:39:46,590 --> 00:39:47,940
She brought the Five Great Sects' elite

727
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:49,340
together on Mount Qihuang

728
00:39:49,630 --> 00:39:51,010
just to kill them all.

729
00:39:51,230 --> 00:39:52,460
The immortal sects went to great lengths

730
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:53,650
to awaken her.

731
00:39:54,760 --> 00:39:55,650
Why would she do this?

732
00:39:55,920 --> 00:39:56,690
Isn't she

733
00:39:57,480 --> 00:39:58,900
supposed to protect the immortal sects?

734
00:40:00,360 --> 00:40:01,010
Qingxing...

735
00:40:01,670 --> 00:40:03,130
Qingxing's on Mount Qihuang too!

736
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:05,650
The seal

737
00:40:06,550 --> 00:40:08,490
on Mount Qihuang has them all trapped.

738
00:40:09,230 --> 00:40:10,170
Only Qi Fengyin

739
00:40:10,670 --> 00:40:12,050
knows how to break it.

740
00:40:14,710 --> 00:40:15,460
I have an idea.

741
00:40:16,030 --> 00:40:17,210
I can turn into demonic mist

742
00:40:17,360 --> 00:40:18,880
and shield you until you reach the artifact.

743
00:40:19,960 --> 00:40:21,350
A hit from that divine light

744
00:40:21,350 --> 00:40:22,460
will tear your skin open.

745
00:40:22,710 --> 00:40:23,740
A few hits would be enough

746
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:24,690
to kill you.

747
00:40:27,840 --> 00:40:29,050
Unlike you, I can take it.

748
00:40:29,590 --> 00:40:31,250
We need blood from your heart

749
00:40:31,250 --> 00:40:32,170
to control the divine artifact.

750
00:40:32,630 --> 00:40:33,650
There's no time to hesitate.

751
00:40:33,840 --> 00:40:34,820
If you can't take it,

752
00:40:34,960 --> 00:40:35,780
tell me right away.

753
00:40:36,030 --> 00:40:36,570
Okay.

754
00:41:06,670 --> 00:41:07,090
Youyou,

755
00:41:07,510 --> 00:41:08,130
are you all right?

756
00:41:08,920 --> 00:41:10,780
I'm fine. Don't worry about me!

757
00:41:46,400 --> 00:41:46,900
Qi Fengyin.

758
00:41:47,510 --> 00:41:48,090
Qi Fengyin!

759
00:41:55,230 --> 00:41:55,780
Qi Fengyin?

760
00:42:02,320 --> 00:42:03,060
I can't break the binding spell

761
00:42:03,060 --> 00:42:03,860
the Saintess put on you.

762
00:42:04,590 --> 00:42:06,380
Defeating her may be the only way.

763
00:42:06,710 --> 00:42:07,530
What are you doing here?

764
00:42:07,840 --> 00:42:08,820
To save you, of course.

765
00:42:09,880 --> 00:42:10,490
Tell me

766
00:42:10,840 --> 00:42:11,460
how to break

767
00:42:11,510 --> 00:42:12,490
the seal on Mount Qihuang.

768
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:17,460
This wisp of dark energy

769
00:42:18,230 --> 00:42:19,650
will help you break it.

770
00:42:33,190 --> 00:42:33,820
Qi Fengyin,

771
00:42:34,760 --> 00:42:35,210
wait for me.

772
00:42:54,440 --> 00:42:57,090
Even if we die fighting today,

773
00:42:57,800 --> 00:42:59,420
we must protect our disciples!

774
00:43:22,840 --> 00:43:23,940
Use your immortal core

775
00:43:24,440 --> 00:43:25,780
to sustain our blood pact.

776
00:43:26,070 --> 00:43:26,780
It will allow me

777
00:43:26,840 --> 00:43:27,820
to appear briefly beside you.

778
00:43:28,710 --> 00:43:29,340
If something unexpected

779
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:30,170
happens tomorrow,

780
00:43:31,190 --> 00:43:32,650
we can use it to back each other up.

781
00:43:33,110 --> 00:43:33,610
All right.

782
00:43:50,230 --> 00:43:51,460
The seal on Mount Qihuang is broken.

783
00:43:51,800 --> 00:43:52,780
Everyone, withdraw at once!

784
00:43:53,320 --> 00:43:54,210
Who dares leave?

785
00:43:54,400 --> 00:43:55,490
By the power of the Immortal Sect Token,

786
00:43:55,920 --> 00:43:57,210
I command the Five Great Sects

787
00:43:58,000 --> 00:43:59,300
to kill Yamao!

788
00:43:59,510 --> 00:44:00,210
God-Sealing Mirror!

789
00:44:12,590 --> 00:44:13,210
Master!

790
00:44:54,030 --> 00:44:55,210
He's done so much for me.

791
00:44:55,320 --> 00:44:56,050
Was it for you

792
00:44:56,230 --> 00:44:57,540
or for the mystical flower?

793
00:44:57,670 --> 00:44:59,530
I spent a thousand years on Mount Qihuang.

794
00:44:59,550 --> 00:45:01,130
Everything I did was for it.

795
00:45:01,320 --> 00:45:02,210
I can't just give it up.

796
00:45:02,360 --> 00:45:03,420
But my life?

797
00:45:03,480 --> 00:45:04,530
You can give that up?

798
00:45:04,840 --> 00:45:07,010
All you ever really cared about

799
00:45:08,440 --> 00:45:10,210
was this stupid flower!

800
00:45:44,140 --> 00:45:49,900
♪Life and death find no harbor in your cloudy eyes♪

801
00:45:51,380 --> 00:45:57,020
♪Words across a thousand years gently caress the abyss♪

802
00:45:57,660 --> 00:46:04,540
♪One thought sows karma. Who knows right from wrong? Love entwines the stars♪

803
00:46:04,660 --> 00:46:10,580
♪We cross paths through lifetimes, rekindling the sparks of time♪

804
00:46:12,100 --> 00:46:17,740
♪In this fleeting, haunted life, good and evil blur, ensnaring you and me♪

805
00:46:19,420 --> 00:46:25,100
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world♪

806
00:46:25,420 --> 00:46:29,860
♪Dawn and dusk gain color at our fingertips♪

807
00:46:29,980 --> 00:46:32,940
♪Our vows live on in ink♪

808
00:46:33,060 --> 00:46:38,780
♪No matter what storms may rise behind us♪

809
00:46:39,620 --> 00:46:42,060
♪One day, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

810
00:46:42,060 --> 00:46:46,660
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

811
00:46:46,660 --> 00:46:49,020
♪Sleepless through bloodshed and strife♪

812
00:46:49,020 --> 00:46:53,220
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

813
00:46:53,460 --> 00:46:55,740
♪Across vast mountains and rivers♪

814
00:46:55,740 --> 00:46:57,540
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

815
00:46:57,540 --> 00:47:00,460
♪Together, we'll walk through time's depths and shallows♪

816
00:47:00,460 --> 00:47:02,620
♪Before all splendor fades♪

817
00:47:02,620 --> 00:47:07,260
♪With no regrets, we etch a lifetime of devotion♪

818
00:47:07,780 --> 00:47:10,180
♪In this life, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

819
00:47:10,220 --> 00:47:14,820
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

820
00:47:14,820 --> 00:47:17,180
♪We cannot escape the wind and snow♪

821
00:47:17,220 --> 00:47:21,380
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

822
00:47:21,620 --> 00:47:23,900
♪As seas turn to fields♪

823
00:47:23,900 --> 00:47:25,700
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

824
00:47:25,700 --> 00:47:28,620
♪Together, we'll break free of the cocoon fate has spun♪

825
00:47:28,620 --> 00:47:30,740
♪Before all splendor fades♪

826
00:47:30,740 --> 00:47:39,780
♪With no regrets, we etch a lifetime of devotion♪
